  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 9 is the longest at Texas Army Trail at 562 feet — a par 4 that captures the course's whole identity: long, open, and demanding accuracy over power. A big placed drive, a clean approach, and you've earned a birdie look on the most talked-about hole in Cypress.",
